  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62391,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 96,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> primitive tumour with a variable degree of neuroectodermal differentiation, as seen in brain tumours; positivity for CD99, FLI1, and GFAP.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T17:55:35"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62392,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 96,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "<p>This entity is staged according to the Union for International Cancer Control (UICC) TNM classification (see <em>TNM staging of ovarian, fallopian tube, and primary peritoneal carcinoma</em>&nbsp;[[Brierley JD, Gospodarowicz MK, Wittekind C, editors. TNM classification of malignant tumours. 8th ed. Oxford (UK): Wiley-Blackwell; 2017.]]) and the FIGO staging system.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-07-15T11:40:40"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 62393,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 96,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Limited clinical data suggest that stage is the most important prognostic factor for these tumours {8393302; 28296680}. Differentiated tumours are associated with better prognosis {8393302; 28296680; 30074494}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-05-13T17:55:35"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]